        "id": "yixuan-ex_special_attack-ink_manifestation",
        "name": "Ink Manifestation (EX Special Attack)",
        "description": "With enough Adrenaline, press or hold [EX] to activate:\n\nCharge continuously, and release [EX] to launch an upward wing attack, dealing massive Auric Ink DMG.\n\nWhile charging, incoming attacks are automatically blocked and will activate the upward wing attack. If hit at the exact moment charging begins, it triggers a /bPerfect Block//b effect, negating the DMG and increasing the skill's Interrupt Level to match a /bHeavy Defensive Assist//b, and recovering 10 Adrenaline.\n\nWhen an upward wing strike hits an enemy with a red flash or yellow flash, a /bPerfect Block//b can be triggered, negating the hit and increasing the skill's Interrupt Level to match a /bDefensive Assist//b and recovering 10 Adrenaline.\n\nThe /bPerfect Block//b effect can occur at most once every 0.5s. If charged until flashing or when triggering the /bPerfect Block//b effect, the upward wing attack can be followed by an additional /bTalisman Attack//b.\n\nAfter the skill, press [SPECIAL] to launch /bEX Special Attack: Celestial Cloud Blitz - Break//b.\n\nAfter /bEX Special Attack: Celestial Cloud Blitz - Break//b, and with enough Adrenaline, press [EX] to consume another 20 Adrenaline to launch /bEX Special Attack: Qingming Eruption - Break//b.\n\nAfter using /bEX Special Attack: Qingming Eruption - Break//b and with enough /bAuric Ink Points//b, hold [DODGE] to quickly follow up with /bBasic Attack: Auric Array//b.\n\nCharacter is invulnerable during the upward wing attack, and Anti-Interrupt Level is increased while charging.",
