        "name": "EX Special Attack: Endless Talisman Suppression - Break (Mindscape Cinema N°6)",
        "description": "When an /bUltimate//b or /bEX Special Attack//b deals DMG, it ignores 15% of the target's Ether RES. Triggering /bUltimate: Qingming Skyshade//b extends all enemies' Stunned state by 3s. In a single Stun state duration, enemies can only have this effect applied once, and it does not stack with similar effects.\n\nAdditionally, when using /bUltimate: Endless Talisman Suppression//b, gain one stack of the /bCondensed Ink//b effect.\n\nAfter /bBasic Attack: Qingming Eruption//b or /bEX Special Attack: Ashen Ink Becomes Shadows//b, press the [BASIC] button, or after /bEX Special Attack//b: Qingming Eruption - Break, press the [SPECIAL] button to consume one stack of /bCondensed Ink//b and launch /bEX Special Attack: Endless Talisman Suppression - Break//b, dealing DMG up to 1,200% of Sheer Force. Only one stack of /bCondensed Ink//b can be held at a time.",
